 प्रभावित क्षेत्रको लागि विशेष मौसम बुलेटिन -२१  ( Bhotekoshi Flood Affected Area’s Special Weather Bulletin - 21) (जारी मिति ː २०८३/०६/०३  साँझ ०५:३० बजे)","url":"https://dhm.gov.np/mfd/#/weather/pages/special-weather/12281","issued_at":"2026-09-19T17:44:55+05:45","page_id":12281},"forecast":{"src":"dhm_country","issued_at":"2026-09-26T08:00:00+05:45","label":{"ne":"आज","en":"Today"},"analysis":{"ne":"हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको साथै पश्चिमी वायुको पनि आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। साथै भारतको उत्तर छत्तीसगढ तथा उत्तर पूर्वी मध्य प्रदेशमा रहेको न्यून चापीय प्रणाली (Depression) उत्तर-उत्तरपश्चिमतर्फ सर्दै भारतको दक्षिणपूर्वी उत्तर प्रदेशतर्फ जाने र आगामी १२ घण्टामा क्रमशः कमजोर भई न्यून चापीय क्षेत्र (Well-Marked Low Pressure Area) मा परिणत हुने सम्भावना रहेको छ। ","en":"Currently, the entire country is under the influence of monsoon winds, along with a partial influence of westerly winds. In addition, the low-pressure system (Depression) currently located over northern Chhattisgarh and northeastern Madhya Pradesh in India is expected to move north-northwestward toward southeastern Uttar Pradesh. The system is likely to gradually weaken over the next 12 hours and transform into a well-marked low-pressure area."},"text":{"ne":" देशभर अधिकांश बादल लाग्नेछ। गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा, तथा कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा, साथै मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको थोरै स्थानमा भारी देखि धेरै भारी वर्षा तथा कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | मधेश प्रदेश तथा बागमती, गण्डकी लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका साथै बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र कर्णाली प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हावाहुरीको समेत सम्भावना छ","en":" Mostly cloudy conditions will prevail across the country. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at many places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Heavy to very heavy rainfall is likely at a few places in Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Windstorms are also likely at some places in Madhesh Province; the Terai regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Sudurpashchim Provinces; and some places in the hilly regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Karnali Provinces.      "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-09-26T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-09-26T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-09-26T08:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-09-26T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T13:32:20+05:45","status":"ok"}}}